  "description": "With young riders pushing the level of riding, smaller bikes need to keep up. The MISFIT 16” is the smallest bike in our line to feature a fully sealed Integrated Headset. Utilizing a CNC machined headtube, also drilled for thread-on Gyro tabs, the headset rests inside the head-tube rather than in press-in cups to avoid broken cups or the lower cup shifting when a fork is bent causing a tight spot in your headset. Also drawing influence from its aftermarket counterpart we’ve lightened up the frame and fork for ’26 creating a bike as limitless as today’s riders imaginations.",
